      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Academy Section 2 — Sales Data Pipeline\n\n**Created by:** n8n Academy Student\n**Date:** 2026-06-22\n\n### What this workflow does\nFetches 50 sales orders from the Academy API and processes them through two parallel branches.\n\n**Branch 1 — Process Orders**\nSplit → Set totals → Aggregate all → POST to process-orders\n\n**Branch 2 — Regional Analysis**\nFilter delivered → Summarize by region → Rename keys → Aggregate → POST to validate-analysis\n\n**Branch 2b — Send Report**\nFrom renamed keys → Add metadata → Convert to CSV → POST to send-report\n\n---\n⚠️ Replace all YOUR_ASSESSMENT_ID_HERE values before running.",
